  "worked_solution": "The product of cube roots of two positive numbers is equal to the cube root of the product of the numbers. Therefore,\n\n$$\n\\sqrt[3]{4}\\cdot \\sqrt[3]{5}=\\sqrt[3]{4\\cdot 5}=\\sqrt[3]{20}.\n$$",
